'''Mumble's Turnaround''' was an [[Outer Rim Territories]] [[hyperspace route]] that ran from the [[planet]] [[Tatooine]] through the worlds of [[Ryloth]] and [[Seylott]], then terminated at the planet [[Roon]]. Ryloth acted as a junction been the Turnaround and the [[Corellian Run]] [[hyperspace]] route. The route also overlapped with the [[Spice Triangle]], a series of trade routes linking Roon, Tatooine and Ryloth. The former [[Pirate Queen|pirate queen]] [[Maz Kanata]] marked Mumble's Turnaround as one of the "real" trade routes to be used by [[smuggler]]s, as opposed to the official ones, on a map that she included in the [[book]] that would become known as the ''[[Smuggler's Guide]]''.<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

==Behind the scenes==
Mumble's Turnaround was first mentioned in ''[[Star Wars: Smuggler's Guide]]'', a reference book written by [[Daniel Wallace]] and released in [[2018]].<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

